Package: libc6-riscv64-cross
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GNU C Library: 64bit Shared libraries for RISC-V cross-compilation
 This package contains the shared libraries for the GNU C Library (glibc 2.38+)
 compiled for RISC-V 64-bit (riscv64) architecture with hwcaps support
 for RVA23U64 profile detection via hwprobe syscall and IFUNC resolvers
 for RVV 1.0 vectorized routines.
 .
 This is a backport of glibc 2.38+ to Debian 13 "Trixie" for KoinV distribution.

Package: libc6-dev-riscv64-cross
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: libc6-riscv64-cross (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: GNU C Library: 64bit Development files for RISC-V cross-compilation
 This package contains the development files (headers, static libraries)
 for the GNU C Library (glibc 2.38+) compiled for RISC-V 64-bit.

